      "message": "chore(process): PROCESS_VERSION 18 - covers the camcraft-mcp skill rows merged with #930\n\nPR #1117 took PROCESS_VERSION 17. PR #930 also changed a process file\n(.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md: rows for set_tool_holder and\nlist_holder_library) while the number stayed 17, because both PRs changed\n16 -> 17 and git merged the identical change. AGENTS.md says the second to\nmerge takes the next number, so forks that synced at 17 would not pull the\n#930 change. This moves the number to 18.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
